  "text": "proprium.dominica-in-septuagesima-graduale",
  "about": "The graduale of the formulary “Septuagesima Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Thou art a helper in due season, in tribulation; let those who know Thy name trust in Thee, for Thou forsakest not those who seek Thee, O Lord. For the poor man shall not be forgotten for ever, nor shall the patience of the poor perish eternally; arise, O Lord, let not man prevail." }
